  "description": "Reconstruction of unstable, unsafe flank chimney stack and external walling together with removal of roof tiling to reduce weight upon roof and timber frame and re-tiling following stabilisation works. \nTimber frame repairs and restoration to the south-west part of Chestnut Cottage.\nWorks to include structural works, replacement and repair of some historic timberwork and some rebuilding of brick walls and foundations, lime render on laths externally and lime plaster on laths internally.\nReplacement flooring to ground floor dining room and hall.\n(Some urgent, essential works already undertaken to stabilise the existing structure for health and safety of the cottage occupants and site operating staff). ",
